    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/b97b0ef5c0da377a13990f6ef53810bd.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/b97b0ef5c0da377a13990f6ef53810bd.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for an adrenaline-fuelled 1980s British bank heist. Play as an ex-SAS miner turned outlaw in a third-person destructible cover shooter. Shoot sneak &amp; smash through punks skinheads &amp; bent coppers then escape through London Master lockpicking safe-cracking &amp; hacking as you plan for the BIG JOB. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/34b6ed640178855a96b34e54511dc599.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/34b6ed640178855a96b34e54511dc599.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting third person cover shooter.\u00a0 With destructible cover, elements of stealth, action and problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/11af0db2f112287b57ee553727b3e745.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/11af0db2f112287b57ee553727b3e745.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations based in a dystopian 1980's Britian. With real life myths and history that play into the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/e583bf0dc80dae665b5e3fe605d4ab0e.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/e583bf0dc80dae665b5e3fe605d4ab0e.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkly satirical humour. With a controversial political undertone, set in a British bank heist game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf82e16e18ac262a9f53b5e04bb80b71.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf82e16e18ac262a9f53b5e04bb80b71.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse and unforgettable enemies that you will love to hate. Based on 80's subcultures, like the Punks (the Blacklegs), Skinheads (the Scabs), crooked Coppers (the Knobsticks) and a corrupt fascist regime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf7be5106fcd5ed30304a39070227326.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf7be5106fcd5ed30304a39070227326.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Large array of popular 80's weapons. Available to add to your arsenal as you plan for the BIG JOB. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/8cabf24f35846b28bd87d99ef425729a.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/8cabf24f35846b28bd87d99ef425729a.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of skills to learn and develop. Throughout the story, such as safe-cracking, lock-picking and computer hacking.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/b97b0ef5c0da377a13990f6ef53810bd.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/b97b0ef5c0da377a13990f6ef53810bd.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for an adrenaline-fuelled 1980s British bank heist. Play as an ex-SAS miner turned outlaw in a third-person destructible cover shooter. Shoot sneak &amp; smash through punks skinheads &amp; bent coppers then escape through London Master lockpicking safe-cracking &amp; hacking as you plan for the BIG JOB. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/34b6ed640178855a96b34e54511dc599.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/34b6ed640178855a96b34e54511dc599.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting third person cover shooter.\u00a0 With destructible cover, elements of stealth, action and problem solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/11af0db2f112287b57ee553727b3e745.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/11af0db2f112287b57ee553727b3e745.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations based in a dystopian 1980's Britian. With real life myths and history that play into the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/e583bf0dc80dae665b5e3fe605d4ab0e.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/e583bf0dc80dae665b5e3fe605d4ab0e.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Darkly satirical humour. With a controversial political undertone, set in a British bank heist game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf82e16e18ac262a9f53b5e04bb80b71.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf82e16e18ac262a9f53b5e04bb80b71.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse and unforgettable enemies that you will love to hate. Based on 80's subcultures, like the Punks (the Blacklegs), Skinheads (the Scabs), crooked Coppers (the Knobsticks) and a corrupt fascist regime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf7be5106fcd5ed30304a39070227326.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/cf7be5106fcd5ed30304a39070227326.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Large array of popular 80's weapons. Available to add to your arsenal as you plan for the BIG JOB. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/8cabf24f35846b28bd87d99ef425729a.poster.avif?t=1751001738\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2456870/extras/8cabf24f35846b28bd87d99ef425729a.webp?t=1751001738\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A range of skills to learn and develop. Throughout the story, such as safe-cracking, lock-picking and computer hacking.</p>",
